1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
What do you mean?

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Exactly what I said.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,000
You're being transferred to the Dualium Mining Department.

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,000
But why so suddenly?

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
You should have read the report I submitted previously.

6
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:19,000
Hm?

7
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Oh, yes.

8
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:25,000
That report about the relationship between entertainment and labor efficiency.

9
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Hm.

10
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Yes, it was very interesting to hear the opinions of someone working in the field.

11
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:34,000
I was promised it would be shown to higher-ups.

12
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Yeah.

13
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:38,000
At Zodiac's direct request.

14
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:40,000
We're counting on you.

15
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,000
What do you mean, Zodiac?

16
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Interesting.

17
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Oh, and by the way,

18
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:50,000
I heard the DES has taken over Akibasta recently.

19
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,000
You know that for sure?

20
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:54,000
I'm surprised you didn't know.

21
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:57,000
What about AKB-0048?

22
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:58,000
Who knows?

23
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:01,000
But I'm sure they'll be captured soon.

24
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:04,000
Keep your chin up.

25
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:07,000
After all, you'll get to see your daughter soon.

26
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:11,000
Give her my regards when you visit her in prison, won't you?

27
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:15,000
Akibasta fell to the DES?

28
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:16,000
Yeah.

29
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:19,000
It should be on the news before too long.

30
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Hm.

31
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:21,000
Hm.

32
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:22,000
Hm.

33
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:25,000
It can't be.

34
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:27,000
That couldn't have happened to Zero Zero.

35
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:28,000
Thank you all.

36
00:01:46,500 --> 00:01:49,000
Fuck.

37
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:53,000
進むための力にする

38
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:59,300
心折れそうな長い桜の前

39
00:01:59,300 --> 00:02:06,460
未来があるなら背を向けられない

40
00:02:06,460 --> 00:02:10,360
友よ覚えているかい?

41
00:02:10,360 --> 00:02:14,080
あの日違い合ったこの場所

42
00:02:14,080 --> 00:02:18,220
季節の花が咲く

43
00:02:18,220 --> 00:02:48,200
I'll see you next time.

44
00:02:48,220 --> 00:02:51,220
I'll see you next time.

45
00:03:18,220 --> 00:03:29,540
Yes, sir. Also, the disappearance of the ninth generation, Yuko Oshima, has been confirmed, but unfortunately, we were unable to control the energy released when she became the Santa Nova.

46
00:03:29,540 --> 00:03:34,520
What an ill-mannered Santa Nova. Midsommar makes her restless.

47
00:03:35,900 --> 00:03:41,700
AKB-0048 and your daughter's whereabouts are currently unknown to us at this time.

48
00:03:42,420 --> 00:03:44,180
Chieri is a lucky child.

49
00:03:44,180 --> 00:03:53,220
Yes, of course. It really is her. Chieri is my shining star.

50
00:03:53,220 --> 00:04:11,760
Kira, drive gone. Engine's failing. We can't determine our coordinates.

51
00:04:12,480 --> 00:04:14,960
So we're broken down and lost to boot.

52
00:04:15,360 --> 00:04:18,840
We escaped from that situation, so be thankful for that much.

53
00:04:18,840 --> 00:04:30,140
It could have been worse. Much worse.

54
00:04:31,880 --> 00:04:32,380
Here.

55
00:04:34,420 --> 00:04:35,960
I'm gonna look around a bit.

56
00:04:35,960 --> 00:04:41,540
How's Tomi-chin and Kochi-haru? Are they… Did they get captured by the DES?

57
00:04:41,980 --> 00:04:44,800
They're okay. They evacuated to the shrine.

58
00:04:45,760 --> 00:04:48,140
Are the people of Aki-basta all right?

59
00:04:49,180 --> 00:04:54,460
The DES is after Zero-Zero. It's more dangerous for us to stay there.

60
00:04:55,460 --> 00:04:58,760
That means they shouldn't harm civilians any further.

61
00:05:01,160 --> 00:05:02,200
Yuko-san.

62
00:05:02,200 --> 00:05:11,740
What about you, Ko-san?

63
00:05:14,880 --> 00:05:15,360
Question.

64
00:05:15,840 --> 00:05:16,080
Anna?

65
00:05:16,360 --> 00:05:20,440
Is it true that Mi-chan was leading the DES in their attack on Aki-basta?

66
00:05:21,160 --> 00:05:22,580
It seems to be.

67
00:05:22,780 --> 00:05:24,040
Why would she do that?

68
00:05:24,620 --> 00:05:25,340
Tsubasa-san.

69
00:05:26,980 --> 00:05:28,600
I have a request to make.

70
00:05:32,200 --> 00:05:39,820
Oh, hello. Time to torture me?

71
00:05:40,540 --> 00:05:44,180
You are fifth-generation Minami Minagishi. You are the Center Nova.

72
00:05:44,620 --> 00:05:45,920
Kanasa, calm down.

73
00:05:47,060 --> 00:05:47,600
Was I?

74
00:05:48,280 --> 00:05:51,220
I wonder if I was actually a true Center Nova.

75
00:05:51,220 --> 00:06:04,760
I don't know. I was scared. I ran away while it was happening.

76
00:06:05,180 --> 00:06:05,480
Huh?

77
00:06:05,840 --> 00:06:06,820
You ran away?

78
00:06:06,820 --> 00:06:06,840
You ran away?

79
00:06:06,840 --> 00:06:32,080
Are you saying the Center Nova's vanished?

80
00:06:32,080 --> 00:06:35,340
All of them were trapped in some other dimension?

81
00:06:36,420 --> 00:06:39,960
If I had kept performing, I'd be trapped too.

82
00:06:41,620 --> 00:06:45,180
Does everyone who becomes a Center Nova go to some other world?

83
00:06:45,840 --> 00:06:46,220
No.

84
00:06:46,760 --> 00:06:48,140
Most people just graduate.

85
00:06:48,500 --> 00:06:50,080
Nothing like that ever happened to them.

86
00:06:50,080 --> 00:06:55,340
Conditions for triggering the Center Nova phenomenon and the disappearances are different.

87
00:06:55,860 --> 00:07:05,100
The three conditions for triggering the phenomenon are a concert on Aki-basta, a violent storm, and finally, a battle during a concert.

88
00:07:05,100 --> 00:07:12,580
But for someone to vanish, the Center Nova must rise to their pinnacle.

89
00:07:13,720 --> 00:07:19,300
They must continue to shine even brighter until the moment they obtain the ultimate light.

90
00:07:20,620 --> 00:07:23,920
In that instant, you vanish into the other world.

91
00:07:26,160 --> 00:07:29,200
Then is Yuko-san in that other world?

92
00:07:29,200 --> 00:07:36,000
She's probably there. In a world with Ah-chan and the others.

93
00:07:37,280 --> 00:07:42,080
Oh, she's alive. Yuko-san is alive.

94
00:07:44,780 --> 00:07:47,160
But what about the ones that didn't vanish?

95
00:07:47,780 --> 00:07:52,580
If your desire to shine wavers for even a moment, then you lose the ultimate light.

96
00:07:53,320 --> 00:07:55,140
And I never tried to get it back.

97
00:07:55,140 --> 00:08:02,040
In order to disappear, the Center Nova must always look upwards and continue climbing.

98
00:08:03,220 --> 00:08:06,260
I was afraid, so I stopped.

99
00:08:07,160 --> 00:08:09,080
So you graduated instead?

100
00:08:09,660 --> 00:08:11,860
Yes. That's exactly what I did.

101
00:08:12,220 --> 00:08:15,460
I immediately abandoned the name Minami Minigishi and fled.

102
00:08:17,120 --> 00:08:19,780
I didn't even perform a graduation concert.

103
00:08:20,100 --> 00:08:21,540
Why did you become a photographer?

104
00:08:21,540 --> 00:08:21,840
I did.

105
00:08:25,140 --> 00:08:33,660
To protect you, I wanted to stay with Zero-Zero and prevent anyone else from disappearing.

106
00:08:34,600 --> 00:08:35,760
Guess I failed, huh?

107
00:08:37,040 --> 00:08:40,760
Okay, so why did you have the DES attack Akibuster at all?

108
00:08:40,840 --> 00:08:41,240
Because.

109
00:08:43,420 --> 00:08:45,900
My father must have something to do with this.

110
00:08:45,900 --> 00:08:54,000
Dualium.

111
00:08:55,360 --> 00:09:02,220
Discovered in the beginning of the 21st century, this unknown substance had a certain unique power.

112
00:09:02,420 --> 00:09:04,160
You want me to take pictures of rocks?

113
00:09:04,500 --> 00:09:06,700
I specialize in girls, not boulders.

114
00:09:06,700 --> 00:09:12,840
By opening gates in space-time, it connects our world to the one on the other side.

115
00:09:13,120 --> 00:09:15,020
An alternate dimension, if you prefer.

116
00:09:16,100 --> 00:09:18,040
What is the world on the other side?

117
00:09:18,040 --> 00:09:24,100
Why ask me, you've already seen it first-hand, Mee-chan.

118
00:09:25,220 --> 00:09:29,640
Former Center Nova and fifth generation Minami Minigishi.

119
00:09:30,420 --> 00:09:31,740
A pleasure to meet you.

120
00:09:33,740 --> 00:09:34,380
Charming.

121
00:09:34,640 --> 00:09:38,780
Now then, while researching Dualium, we stumbled upon a new life.

122
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:40,620
A breed of hyperspace creatures.

123
00:09:41,420 --> 00:09:42,040
Show her.

124
00:09:42,040 --> 00:09:44,040
Kirara?

125
00:09:46,480 --> 00:09:48,140
Dualium and the Kiraras.

126
00:09:48,960 --> 00:09:56,440
Using these two things, the Tsukubo Research Facility successfully developed the first method of interplanetary travel in human history.

127
00:09:57,540 --> 00:09:59,060
The Kirara Drive.

128
00:10:03,720 --> 00:10:05,820
Kiraras respond to a select force.

129
00:10:06,820 --> 00:10:08,720
The will or souls of certain people.

130
00:10:08,720 --> 00:10:12,480
And the people they connect with have their power amplified.

131
00:10:13,280 --> 00:10:14,160
You don't mean…

132
00:10:15,160 --> 00:10:15,660
Yes.

133
00:10:16,680 --> 00:10:17,140
Idols.

134
00:10:17,880 --> 00:10:22,820
In ancient times, long before idols existed,

135
00:10:23,380 --> 00:10:27,060
the arts were sacred rituals performed to connect the gods and other worlds.

136
00:10:28,060 --> 00:10:29,140
If I'm right,

137
00:10:29,960 --> 00:10:32,140
it may somehow be related to this.

138
00:10:32,140 --> 00:10:38,740
So, the reason the DES has been trying to capture Zero-Zero alive is…

139
00:10:38,740 --> 00:10:41,220
To use you and the Kiraras for military purposes.

140
00:10:42,500 --> 00:10:45,000
Oh, I guess that makes sense.

141
00:10:45,300 --> 00:10:48,780
The Center Nova can't make Kiraras shine brighter than anyone else.

142
00:10:48,980 --> 00:10:52,800
And Akibastar has the largest deposit of Dualium discovered.

143
00:10:52,800 --> 00:10:59,720
I told Zodiac about the Dualium in Akibastar, and that a new Center Nova might be born.

144
00:10:59,720 --> 00:11:02,680
That's why they attacked with such overwhelming force.

145
00:11:02,680 --> 00:11:04,680
And the result…

146
00:11:04,680 --> 00:11:07,680
Because of you, Akibastar is…

147
00:11:07,680 --> 00:11:09,680
Where are you going?

148
00:11:09,680 --> 00:11:11,680
I'm going to talk to my father.

149
00:11:11,680 --> 00:11:13,240
You can't do that, Chiyari!

150
00:11:13,240 --> 00:11:13,680
But…

151
00:11:13,680 --> 00:11:15,680
Chiyari, calm down.

152
00:11:15,680 --> 00:11:17,680
Why, Mi-chan?

153
00:11:17,680 --> 00:11:22,680
I thought you wanted to protect the other members!

154
00:11:22,680 --> 00:11:24,680
Answer me!

155
00:11:24,680 --> 00:11:29,680
She wanted to try rescuing the Center Novus who had already disappeared.

156
00:11:29,680 --> 00:11:32,680
Rescue them?

157
00:11:32,680 --> 00:11:35,680
The moment someone becomes a Center Novus,

158
00:11:35,680 --> 00:11:39,680
she wanted to try rescuing the Center Novus who had already disappeared.

159
00:11:39,680 --> 00:11:41,680
Rescue them?

160
00:11:41,680 --> 00:11:44,680
The moment someone becomes a Center Novus,

161
00:11:44,680 --> 00:11:49,680
a gate connecting our world to the other side opens up.

162
00:11:49,680 --> 00:11:51,680
Mi-chan thought she could pass through that gate

163
00:11:51,680 --> 00:11:55,680
and reach Ah-chan and the other missing Center Novus.

164
00:11:55,680 --> 00:12:00,680
That's why she helped Zodiac and waited for her chance.

165
00:12:00,680 --> 00:12:03,680
But she was deceived by Zodiac.

166
00:12:03,680 --> 00:12:05,680
I'm not surprised that happened to her.

167
00:12:05,680 --> 00:12:10,680
But I always thought she'd just end up with a bad boyfriend, not destroy a planet.

168
00:12:10,680 --> 00:12:13,680
Isn't it possible that she's just a traitor?

169
00:12:13,680 --> 00:12:15,680
No, it isn't.

170
00:12:15,680 --> 00:12:17,680
How can you be so sure?

171
00:12:18,680 --> 00:12:19,680
Because…

172
00:12:19,680 --> 00:12:21,680
I'm the same way.

173
00:12:21,680 --> 00:12:22,680
I want…

174
00:12:22,680 --> 00:12:26,680
so badly to rescue the girls we've lost.

175
00:12:26,680 --> 00:12:28,680
I want to see Ah-chan.

176
00:12:28,680 --> 00:12:30,680
Sabasa-san…

177
00:12:30,680 --> 00:12:31,680
Sabasa-san…

178
00:12:31,680 --> 00:12:33,680
She's not the only one.

179
00:12:33,680 --> 00:12:36,680
Sensei-sensei may have been thinking the same thing.

180
00:12:36,680 --> 00:12:38,680
Sensei-sensei too?

181
00:12:38,680 --> 00:12:39,680
Yes.

182
00:12:39,680 --> 00:12:42,680
That's why he revived the general elections,

183
00:12:42,680 --> 00:12:45,680
and attempted to create a new Center Nova.

184
00:12:45,680 --> 00:12:48,680
Is it possible to save her?

185
00:12:50,680 --> 00:12:52,680
If someone becomes the Center Nova,

186
00:12:52,680 --> 00:12:55,680
can we save Yuko-san and the other girls?

187
00:13:01,680 --> 00:13:03,680
Yes, it's possible.

188
00:13:03,680 --> 00:13:16,680
No!

189
00:13:16,680 --> 00:13:18,680
A barrier!

190
00:13:33,680 --> 00:13:36,680
Have we established communication with Sensei-sensei?

191
00:13:36,680 --> 00:13:37,680
Not yet.

192
00:13:37,680 --> 00:13:38,680
We're still trying.

193
00:13:38,680 --> 00:13:40,680
We can't get in touch with Woda, either.

194
00:13:40,680 --> 00:13:41,680
What should we do?

195
00:13:41,680 --> 00:13:43,680
It's getting dangerous.

196
00:13:43,680 --> 00:13:44,680
End the transmission.

197
00:13:44,680 --> 00:13:45,680
Yes, ma'am.

198
00:13:45,680 --> 00:13:48,680
Do the Center Nova's…

199
00:13:48,680 --> 00:13:50,680
Or Ah-chan?

200
00:13:50,680 --> 00:13:53,680
Are you absolutely certain they want to be rescued?

201
00:13:53,680 --> 00:13:58,680
Do you really trust Mii-chan?

202
00:13:58,680 --> 00:14:00,680
Are you sure it's wise?

203
00:14:03,680 --> 00:14:06,680
I was the seventh generation Shinoda Maruko.

204
00:14:06,680 --> 00:14:09,680
Nothing will ever change that fact.

205
00:14:10,680 --> 00:14:12,680
Once you accept a name and an ambition,

206
00:14:14,680 --> 00:14:16,680
you can't throw it away so easily.

207
00:14:20,680 --> 00:14:22,680
Suzuko, what are you doing?

208
00:14:22,680 --> 00:14:26,680
I can't… find anything.

209
00:14:26,680 --> 00:14:27,680
What?

210
00:14:27,680 --> 00:14:30,680
I can't find any information about Zero Zero.

211
00:14:30,680 --> 00:14:32,680
Even all the fan pages are gone.

212
00:14:32,680 --> 00:14:34,680
It's like we don't exist.

213
00:14:34,680 --> 00:14:36,680
Do you think the DES erased them?

214
00:14:36,680 --> 00:14:37,680
It's possible.

215
00:14:37,680 --> 00:14:39,680
Or they increased restrictions.

216
00:14:39,680 --> 00:14:43,680
Either way, the end result is painfully obvious.

217
00:14:43,680 --> 00:14:44,680
You mean…

218
00:14:45,680 --> 00:14:46,680
It's over.

219
00:14:49,680 --> 00:14:51,680
Do you think it's gonna end like this?

220
00:14:52,680 --> 00:14:53,680
I hope it doesn't.

221
00:14:55,680 --> 00:14:57,680
I wanted to become an elected member.

222
00:14:59,680 --> 00:15:01,680
I wanted to become a successor.

223
00:15:01,680 --> 00:15:02,680
I see.

224
00:15:02,680 --> 00:15:14,680
Mii-chan… did what she did to save the center novas.

225
00:15:14,680 --> 00:15:16,680
We don't know if it's true.

226
00:15:16,680 --> 00:15:17,680
Remember that.

227
00:15:17,680 --> 00:15:18,680
Kanata…

228
00:15:18,680 --> 00:15:21,680
I don't care if her intentions were purer.

229
00:15:21,680 --> 00:15:22,680
Yeah.

230
00:15:22,680 --> 00:15:24,680
I still don't think I could forgive her.

231
00:15:24,680 --> 00:15:32,680
Chiyori, sorry about earlier.

232
00:15:32,680 --> 00:15:36,680
I shouldn't have said you can't talk to your father.

233
00:15:36,680 --> 00:15:37,680
It's okay.

234
00:15:37,680 --> 00:15:39,680
You were absolutely right.

235
00:15:39,680 --> 00:15:40,680
But still…

236
00:15:40,680 --> 00:15:44,680
I have to think of a way to settle things with him for good.

237
00:15:44,680 --> 00:15:47,680
But to be honest, I don't know how.

238
00:15:48,680 --> 00:15:52,680
I'll figure it out though.

239
00:15:52,680 --> 00:15:54,680
If it's the last thing I do.

240
00:15:57,680 --> 00:16:00,680
Are you worried about Yuko?

241
00:16:00,680 --> 00:16:01,680
Hmm…

242
00:16:01,680 --> 00:16:05,680
I'm thinking…

243
00:16:05,680 --> 00:16:06,680
Well…

244
00:16:06,680 --> 00:16:09,680
Of becoming the center nova.

245
00:16:09,680 --> 00:16:13,680
I'll become the center nova.

246
00:16:13,680 --> 00:16:17,680
Open the gate to the other world.

247
00:16:17,680 --> 00:16:21,680
And save everyone who's been taken away.

248
00:16:21,680 --> 00:16:22,680
You can't do that, Nagisa.

249
00:16:22,680 --> 00:16:23,680
Just becoming the center nova is difficult enough.

250
00:16:23,680 --> 00:16:24,680
You'd be aiming for something beyond that.

251
00:16:24,680 --> 00:16:25,680
It's impossible.

252
00:16:25,680 --> 00:16:26,680
I know…

253
00:16:26,680 --> 00:16:27,680
We don't even know what's going to happen to Zero-Zero.

254
00:16:27,680 --> 00:16:28,680
This may have lost everything.

255
00:16:28,680 --> 00:16:29,680
I know…

256
00:16:29,680 --> 00:16:30,680
But I have to try.

257
00:16:30,680 --> 00:16:31,680
Did they find us?

258
00:16:31,680 --> 00:16:32,680
They must have followed our troops.

259
00:16:32,680 --> 00:16:33,680
I know…

260
00:16:33,680 --> 00:16:34,680
I know…

261
00:16:34,680 --> 00:16:35,680
But I have to try…

262
00:16:35,680 --> 00:16:36,680
Did they find us?

263
00:16:36,680 --> 00:16:37,680
They must have followed our troops.

264
00:16:37,680 --> 00:16:38,680
I know…

265
00:16:38,680 --> 00:16:39,680
I know…

266
00:16:39,680 --> 00:16:40,680
But I have to try…

267
00:16:40,680 --> 00:16:41,680
